<title>JAPAN: Tohoku Telecom - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Tohoku Telecom - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 43.26		vs	   39.96</p>
<p> Operating	    1.18		vs	  408    million</p>
<p> Current		1.33		vs	  596    million</p>
<p> Net	    573    million	  vs	  372    million</p>
<p> EPS		   23.15 yen	  vs	   15.09 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 22.84 yen	  vs	   14.86 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tohoku Telecommunications Construction Co Ltd is a medium-sized telecommunications engineering company.</p>
